					"speakerTitle": "阿科米蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300137,
					"content": "結果每個都這樣，想當廢物都不好意思。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300138
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿科米蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300114,
					"content": "為什麼會答應他們偷龍？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300115
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750300115,
					"content": "唔…我以為飛行隊的馭龍師會很珍惜絨翼龍的說…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
