					"id": 750300602,
					"content": "喂，有人嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300603
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750300603,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "向下看"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300604,
					"content": "是誰？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿科米蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300605,
					"content": "我們把龍販子趕走了，你可以出來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300606,
					"content": "…還是不了，就讓我自己在地窖裡待著吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿科米蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300607,
					"content": "#謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}們幫忙，我也沒什麼好禮物可以拿來答謝{F#妳}{M#你}們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿科米蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300608,
					"content": "#不嫌棄的話，我在營地裡存了點東西，{F#妳}{M#你}們隨便拿吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿科米蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300609,
					"content": "不解釋一下嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300610
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750300610,
					"content": "#害{F#妳}{M#你}們被捲進這種無聊的事來，我很抱歉。不過說了也沒什麼用，算了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿科米蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300611,
					"content": "#這是什麼解釋啊？我和{NICKNAME}在路上走得好好的，突然就有人大喊：「我連{F#妳}{M#你}一起揍」，然後就衝過來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300612,
					"content": "#如果{M#他}{F#她}反應慢一點，我們就會受傷——不對，已經受傷了，我們的精神受到了衝擊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300613,
						750300614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300613,
					"content": "需要精神賠償。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300615
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750300615,
					"content": "怎麼想都很嚴重吧？我們好歹也是冒險家協會登記在冊的知名冒險家，受協會保護，我們要求一個解釋！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300616,
					"content": "（協會會保護我們嗎？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300617
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750300617,
					"content": "（其實我也不知道，按照之前的經驗來看，我懷疑不會。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300618,
					"content": "#這…我也不是故意的，怪我做什麼…反正{F#妳}{M#你}們也進不來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿科米蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300619,
					"content": "#可惡，這傢伙藏在地窖裡，{NICKNAME}我們去找他！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300620,
					"content": "#不要浪費力氣了。就算我告訴{F#妳}{M#你}們營地裡有兩條路直通地窖，<color=#00E1FFFF>但知道這兩條路的也只有龍</color>，{F#妳}{M#你}們不可能有辦法，還是走吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "阿科米蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300614,
					"content": "我的手擦傷了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300615
					]
				}
			]
		},
